meta {
  name: 21. Cleanup - Delete Group
  type: http
  seq: 21
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/groups/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: {{sagaGroupId}}
}

docs {
  ## Cleanup – Delete Group

  **Precondition:** `sagaGroupId` is set.

  **Expected Response**
  - Status: `204 No Content`

  **System Impact**

  | System | Expected Change |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | Group record removed from `portal_backend` DB |
  | Config Adapter | Consumes `de.civitascore.idm.group.deleted` Kafka event; forwards deletion to Keycloak |
  | Keycloak | Group removed from `civitas-core` realm |
}
